<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 488 0 R
/E (Pactum de non agendo means "an agreement not to sue." It is a covenant where a party promises not to initiate legal action for a specific time. Crucially, it suspends the remedy \(the right to go to court\) but does not destroy the underlying legal right.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
