207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Section 28 of the Indian Contract Act: Absolute, permanent restrictions on suing are void. However, this maxim is recognized because it is temporary or conditional, not a total bar to justice.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
